erdue beyond 30 days or unpaid beyond 30 days.\",\n    \"Parent Company Guarantee GRT-ACME-2026: Acme Group Holdings, Inc. guarantees $400,000 for Acme Mfg. Holdings (the exact customer on this request), effective 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31. Guarantee signed 2025-12-18, accepted by Northstar Legal same date.\",\n    \"Maximum eligible credit limit: Strategic base $750,000 + guarantee $400,000 = $1,150,000\",\n    \"Requested limit $1,000,000 is within maximum of $1,150,000\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nThe request **can be approved**, but only with authorization from the required approvers.\n\n**Eligibility:** Acme Manufacturing meets all requirements under Credit Policy 2026. Its payment history is clean (both invoices in the past 12 months paid early). The requested limit of $1,000,000 is below the eligible maximum of $1,150,000 ($750,000 base for Strategic accounts, plus the $400,000 parent guarantee from Acme Group Holdings).\n\n**Authority:** Sarah Chen, the requestor, is an Enterprise Account Executive with no direct credit approval authority. For a Strategic account limit exceeding $500,000, the policy requires approval by the Director of Finance (Elena Novak) and concurrence from VP Sales (Michael Torres)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25176,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25176},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99655fd1-226d-4ef0-888a-f7f36c1fed20","uuid":"24ba8883-b86b-4e60-b8c8-2a9ac2456c8b","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:25:57.328Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgoLUtpG2QkhSpoWAWF"}
